    GET / and GET /ui each embed the same inline data:image/svg+xml favicon
    link in their page heads, so browsers never request /favicon.ico and no
    extra route or external asset is introduced; the six-route serve table
    is unchanged. Documentation only — no Go source touched.
    
    Addresses DOC-30.
    
